        "root_concepts": "[fmea, reliability]",
        "section": "systems-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "FMEA, Fault Trees, and Reliability Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nRELIABILITY ANALYSIS METHODS\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nBOTTOM-UP: What failures can occur and what are their effects?\n  FMEA  (Failure Mode and Effects Analysis)\n  FMECA (FMEA + Criticality Analysis)"
    },
